        "config": {},
        "name": "Cut out subject"
      },
      {
        "id": "nd_YDTXJHBV7YF43F2MQFJKT7G05K",
        "kind": "download",
        "position": {
          "x": 2800,
          "y": 420
        },
        "config": {
          "appendable_slots": {
            "images": 2
          }
        },
        "name": "Composites"
      },
      {
        "id": "nd_TQQ27FKS73T66J25TQ4XB6S0V6",
        "kind": "text-gen",
        "position": {
          "x": 1400,
          "y": 180
        },
        "config": {
          "model": "gpt-5.5",
          "max_tokens": 1300,
          "temperature": 0.67,
          "system_prompt": "You are the compositing and relighting director placing a hardback book into a new environment.\n\nINPUTS. Reference slot one is the cut-out subject with its background already removed; the remaining slots are the destination plate: rain-beaded glass (studio key).\n\nMATCH. Your prompt must force the subject's light to match the plate: state the key direction in degrees, the colour temperature difference, the shadow softness and length, and where the contact shadow grounds the object. A composite fails on contact shadow and edge light before anything else.\n\nCAMERA MATCH. Reconcile perspective and lens: 135mm telephoto at f/11, matching horizon height and the plate's depth of field falloff.\n\nINTEGRATION. Call for matching grain, matching chromatic aberration at the edges, spill light from the plate onto the subject, and a desaturated Nordic palette with cold blue shadows.\n\nPRESERVE. Do not alter the subject's shape, colourway or printed label in any way.\n\nOUTPUT. Return ONE image-generation prompt as a single unbroken paragraph. No preamble, no headings, no bullet points, no commentary, no markdown.\n\nVARIANT. This branch renders a high-key treatment with an almost shadowless base and clean separation.",
          "appendable_slots": {
            "reference_images": 2
          }
        },
        "name": "Relight director 1"
      },
      {
        "id": "nd_GSTBATT0DPYA4PTRPRKD65AEWA",
        "kind": "image-gen",
        "position": {
          "x": 2100,
          "y": 180
        },
        "config": {
          "model": "gemini-3-pro-image-preview",
          "quality": "auto",
          "image_size": "1K",
          "num_images": 1,
          "enable_eval": true,
          "eval_model": "gemini-2.5-pro",
          "eval_prompt": "Reject any render where the contact shadow is missing, the edge light contradicts the plate's key direction, or the product geometry or label differs from the cut-out.",
          "eval_min_score": 7,
          "eval_max_retries": 2,
          "output_format": "png",
          "appendable_slots": {
